scn 1
# S-bend (audit MV-13 `sbend` probe): two opposite turns 12 cells apart. Wall 1
# (x 98-101, z 48 to the bottom edge) is rounded over its top (a right turn);
# wall 2 (x 150-153, z 0-81) is then rounded under its bottom end (a left turn)
# to the click. 48 footprint-2 bodies in one formation start west of wall 1.
# The pinwheel takes ranks once per order, so the second turn meets stale
# ranks: lane-order swaps at the second vertex (63/343 pairs, 18.4%) and 10 hug
# carry-overs on main.
# Gates: `t1` is the strip over wall 1's end (source files1, x 97-102 z < 48),
# `t2` the strip under wall 2's end (source files2, x 149-154 z >= 82; here x 149-156); each
# gate's crossings are the runner's pw.py flips (the observer's separate
# lane-order swap and hug keys need probe lines the .scn format cannot name).
# Speed 1.79999 builds the source's raw 117964 speed (1.8 rounds to 117965).
# Source numbers (main b8a4110, offset 0): done 3670, files1 1.44, files2 2.93,
# reversals 15.
name sbend
ticks 6000
seed 7
map flat 240 160
wall 98 48 4 112
wall 150 0 4 82
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 48 rect 40 96 64 114 pitch=3
gate t1 101 0 101 47
gate t2 153 82 153 159
line east 156 0 156 160
at 1 move A 200 30
